From Coq Require Import ZArith List.
From compcert Require Import Integers AST Ctypes Values Memory Events Clight ClightBigstep.
Require Import OriginalC.jet_secp_scalar_public_calls.
Require Import OriginalC.jet_secp_scalar_public_rest.
Require Import OriginalC.jet_secp_scalar_public_setup.
Require Import OriginalC.jet_secp_scalar_public_lifecycle.
Require Import OriginalC.jet_secp_scalar_zero_local.
Import ListNotations.
Local Open Scope Z_scope.
Set Default Timeout 60.
Set Printing Width 120.
Set Printing Depth 100000.
Check OriginalC.jet_secp_scalar_public_calls.scalar_public_read_symbols.
Check OriginalC.jet_secp_scalar_public_calls.scalar_public_zero_symbols.
Check OriginalC.jet_secp_scalar_public_calls.exec_scalar_public_read.
Check OriginalC.jet_secp_scalar_public_calls.exec_scalar_public_zero.
Check OriginalC.jet_secp_scalar_public_calls.scalar_zero_foot_block.
Check OriginalC.jet_secp_scalar_public_calls.exec_scalar_public_read_and_test.
Check OriginalC.jet_secp_scalar_public_rest.scalar_public_rest_eq.
Check OriginalC.jet_secp_scalar_public_rest.canonical_scalar_zero_encoded.
Check OriginalC.jet_secp_scalar_public_rest.scalar_locals_not_foot.
Check OriginalC.jet_secp_scalar_public_rest.exec_scalar_public_rest_canonical.
Check OriginalC.jet_secp_scalar_public_setup.scalar_alloc_lframe.
Check OriginalC.jet_secp_scalar_public_setup.scalar_alloc_fresh.
Check OriginalC.jet_secp_scalar_public_setup.scalar_alloc_freeable.
Check OriginalC.jet_secp_scalar_public_setup.scalar_alloc_source_fields.
Check OriginalC.jet_secp_scalar_public_setup.scalar_prepare_public_locals.
Check OriginalC.jet_secp_scalar_public_lifecycle.scalar_zero_public_body.
Check OriginalC.jet_secp_scalar_public_lifecycle.eval_secp_scalar_zero_canonical.
Check OriginalC.jet_secp_scalar_zero_local.scalar_zero_local_spec.
Print OriginalC.jet_secp_scalar_public_calls.scalar_public_read_stmt.
Print OriginalC.jet_secp_scalar_public_calls.scalar_public_zero_stmt.
Print OriginalC.jet_secp_scalar_public_rest.scalar_public_rest.
